      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "b0eyy2p",
      "content": "The traditional sports of Chhattisgarh include Kabaddi, Kho-Kho, Gilli Danda, Pittul, Bhaunra (top spinning), and various tribal games. The state participates in the National Games and has won medals at the state level."
